{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENGramka.png?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the tiny paws of a mouse spending the weekend at home with a dysfunctional Dad while Mom's away. Be on your best behavior and KEEP DADDY HAPPY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENG01.png?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/1GIF_Demons_final.gif?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You all live together. You, Dad, Mom, Brother, and the rest of the demons. Try not to cause problems so you don't have to be punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENG02.png?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/2GIF_Sprzatanie_final.gif?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scrub, sweep, clean, make fries, kill spiders, bring Daddy his pills\u2014essentially, be a good kid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENG03.png?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/3GIF_explore_final.gif?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the house and look for treats and action figures scattered around. This might be the only fun part about living here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENG04.png?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/4GIF_justgetby_final.gif?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit various parts of the house, face difficult situations, and experience the gruesome reality of a child-mouse trying to maintain a sense of normalcy in an abnormal household.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENG05.png?t=1742569812\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3094480?t=1742569812","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742569812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/2af277fb36b5ea1392c1c38f2d9bbcaddb051a29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742569812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/2af277fb36b5ea1392c1c38f2d9bbcaddb051a29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742569812","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3374350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3094480/extras/ENGramka.png?t=1742569812\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the tiny paws of a mouse spending the weekend at home with a dysfunctional Dad while Mom's away. Be on your best 